{"title": "Scarlet Feast", "pageid": 26472, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scarlet_Feast", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scarlet_Feast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scarlet_Feast.webp/300px-Scarlet_Feast.webp, /w/images/8/8e/Scarlet_Feast.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scarlet_Feast.webp/300px-Scarlet_Feast.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Scarlet_Feast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Scarlet Feast</b> is a special class action available to the wielder of <a href=\"/wiki/Rhapsody\" title=\"Rhapsody\">Rhapsody</a>. After killing three creatures, the wielder can expend all three <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Remittance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\">Scarlet Remittance</a> charges to cast one of three actions which can heal the wielder, guarantee a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hit</a>, or impose <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on a target's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nIf you have a +3 bonus from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Remittance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\">Scarlet Remittance</a>, consume it to empower yourself in combat.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\">